      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Much of what we were taught in dental school is no longer valid. In this article, I've examined some of the myths surrounding what I have dubbed the \"inferior\" inferior alveolar nerve block. Using the X-tip anesthesia system, it is now possible to achieve total, instant and profound anesthesia of the \"hot\" tooth, without the problems formerly associated with intraosseous injections."},
